(SUPPLY AGREEMENT - TECHNICAL FABRICS                           Ref: KBS/NTL/2026) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (BETWEEN) Tj
T* (\(1\) Northfell Textiles Ltd, a company registered in England \(no. 04417826\) whose) Tj
T* (    registered office is at Mill 3, Calder Bank Road, Halifax HX1 4RT \("Supplier"\); and) Tj
T* (\(2\) Kestrel Bay Supplies Ltd, a company registered in England \(no. 11482730\) whose) Tj
T* (    registered office is at 14 Quayside Lane, Bristol BS1 6XJ \("Customer"\).) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (BACKGROUND) Tj
T* (A. The parties have traded under a letter of terms dated 14 June 2023, which) Tj
T* (   expires on 31 March 2026.) Tj
T* (B. The Customer wishes to secure supply of coated technical fabrics for its tent) Tj
T* (   and outerwear ranges on the terms below.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (1. TERM) Tj
T* (1.1 This Agreement starts on 1 April 2026 \(the "Commencement Date"\) and ends on) Tj
T* (    31 March 2028 unless terminated earlier under clause 9.) Tj
T* (1.2 Either party may propose a renewal by written notice no later than) Tj
T* (    30 September 2027.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (2. PRODUCTS, PRICES AND VOLUMES) Tj
T* (2.1 The Supplier will supply the fabrics in Schedule 1 at the prices in Schedule 2.) Tj
T* (    Prices are fixed until 31 March 2027.) Tj
T* (2.2 From 1 April 2027 the Supplier may increase prices once, by no more than) Tj
T* (    UK CPI plus 1%, on 60 days' written notice.) Tj
T* (2.3 The Customer will order at least 18,000 linear metres per contract year. If it) Tj
T* (    orders less, it will pay a shortfall fee of 0.40 GBP per metre.) Tj
T* (3. ORDERS AND DELIVERY) Tj
T* (3.1 Orders are placed by purchase order. Standard lead time is 21 days.) Tj
T* (3.2 Delivery is DAP Unit 4, Portway Trade Park, Avonmouth, Bristol BS11 9QD.) Tj
T* (3.3 Each batch is supplied with a certificate of conformity.) Tj
T* (4. QUALITY) Tj
T* (4.1 Fabrics must meet Schedule 1, including hydrostatic head \(flysheet minimum) Tj
T* (    3,000 mm; groundsheet minimum 5,000 mm\).) Tj
T* (4.2 The Customer may reject non-conforming goods within 14 days of delivery. The) Tj
T* (    Supplier will replace them within 10 working days at its own cost.) Tj
T* (5. PAYMENT) Tj
T* (5.1 The Customer will pay undisputed invoices within 45 days of invoice date.) Tj
T* (6. EXCLUSIVITY) Tj
T* (6.1 During the term the Supplier will not sell the "Kestrel olive" colourway) Tj
T* (    \(code NT-RS70-OL\) to any other outdoor retailer in the UK or Ireland.) Tj
T* (7. LIABILITY) Tj
T* (7.1 Each party's total liability in a contract year is capped at the fees paid or) Tj
T* (    payable in that year, except for death, personal injury or fraud.) Tj
T* (8. CONFIDENTIALITY) Tj
T* (8.1 Each party will keep the other's pricing, volumes and designs confidential) Tj
T* (    during the term and for three years after it ends.) Tj
T* (9. TERMINATION) Tj
T* (9.1 Either party may terminate on written notice if the other commits a material) Tj
T* (    breach not remedied within 30 days, or becomes insolvent.) Tj
T* (10. GOVERNING LAW - the law of England and Wales.) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Signed for Northfell Textiles Ltd            Signed for Kestrel Bay Supplies Ltd) Tj
T* (Peter Holroyd, Managing Director             Helen Marsh, Chief Executive) Tj
T* ([signature]                                  [signature]) Tj
T* () Tj
T* (Date of signature: 2 March 2026) Tj
T* () Tj
